Package: bbsrgeo
Title: Access and Convert BBSR Area Crosswalks for German Regional
    Statistics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Stefan", "Moog", email = "stefan.moog@prognos.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to download and read the area crosswalks
    ('Umstiegsschluessel') for municipalities and districts published by
    the BBSR (Bundesinstitut fuer Bau-, Stadt- und Raumforschung, Germany's
    Federal Institute for Research on Building, Urban Affairs and Spatial
    Development), and to convert German regional statistics time series
    from the Regionaldatenbank Deutschland (GENESIS-Regio) onto a
    consistent set of area boundaries. Includes two pairs of example
    datasets, each pairing a Regionaldatenbank Deutschland series
    ('popregio', 'ltcregio') with an independent INKAR reference series
    used to validate the conversion ('popinkar', 'ltcinkar'; INKAR is a
    BBSR data product distinct from the Regionaldatenbank Deutschland),
    all licensed under the 'Datenlizenz Deutschland - Namensnennung -
    Version 2.0' ('dl-de/by-2-0'); see ?popregio, ?popinkar,
    ?ltcregio, and ?ltcinkar for the required attribution.
